{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_wulfen_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_wulfen_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"最后一次探险","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"穆丽儿承接了一项她熟识的网友发布的委托，而在线下见面后，穆丽儿发觉对方的目的其实并不在于“探险”。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_wulfen_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["穆丽儿","“Basalt_Moon”"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"charslot","id":4},{"type":"image","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":7},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_bg_bg_forest.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":8},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$leaveshake","volume":"0.6","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#11$1","focus":"m","duration":"2","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"说真的，你在群聊里撤回的那条消息，还作数吧？","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"就算我撤回了，你现在不还是接了这个“委托”嘛。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"因为当时你写了“最后一次探险”，我……","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":18},{"type":"charslot","id":19},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿有意识地顿了顿，观察着面前人的表情，见对方表情并无异样，才继续说下去。","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"我还以为你对地质勘探失去兴趣了呢。那怎么行，我当初可是看着你的视频成长起来的，你要退坑，我第一个不同意好吧！","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"说得我好像是什么大前辈似的，你实地考察过的地方可比我多得多。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"没想到说着说着，结果就变成网友见面了啊。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"我倒是没怎么构想过网友见面这种事……BM，你还是我第一个线下见面的网友呢！","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"不过……","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"我设想中的见面可不是这样的场景啊——","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":33},{"type":"charslot","id":34},{"type":"text","text":"阳光从树冠缝隙间洒下，带着潮湿的水汽，晃动着落在她们脚边的石头堆上。","id":35},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿对着地图和终端中的资料看了半天，原地转了两圈，最后把目光定格在一团绿茫茫的密林上。","id":36},{"type":"dialog","id":37},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":38},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":39},{"type":"charslot","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":41},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_bg_bg_caveentrance2_d.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":42},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"你确定不是这里吗？","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"charslot","id":47},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿已经来到一块被风化的页岩边观察岩层纹路，听到这话，只看了BM一眼，又把注意力转回石头上。","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"刚刚那条小径是废弃的运输路线，很多年没用过了，不在地图上。我们现在的方向偏东南了一些，应该再往西绕回去。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"这里早前下过雨，也不好走，最好还是小心一点。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"你早就知道我们走错了吗？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"嗯哼。我还在想你什么时候会发现呢。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"……好哇，你就是想看我出糗。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"谁让你昨天偷拍我睡觉！还说什么“记录山野生物在自然中的栖息状态”……","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"我、我都没拍你自制的奇怪干粮欸！你不觉得它看起来和我们早上看到的那片岩层剖面很像吗？","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"哈？哪里像了？你不要吃就还我，我不跟你交换便当了。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"嘿嘿，我偏不——","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":67},{"type":"charslot","id":68},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":69},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":70},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.6","id":71},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":72},{"type":"text","text":"BM刚想回应穆丽儿，却脚下一滑，她下意识地抓住身边的一根枯枝，枯枝却被她从土中拽出，连带着松动的石块一起滑落下来。","id":73},{"type":"text","text":"泥沙开始迅速崩塌，她整个人都跟着往下滑。","id":74},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":75},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":76},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch02","volume":"1","id":77},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿瞬间回头，迅速伸手牢牢抓住BM的手腕，同时尾巴立马缠住身边的岩石，稳稳地将自己固定起来。","id":78},{"type":"dialog","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"抓紧我，背包先扔掉！","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"可我的东西……","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"别管了！","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"听我的，背包可以再想办法！","id":83},{"type":"dialog","id":84},{"type":"charslot","id":85},{"type":"text","text":"BM咬了咬牙，终于松开背包，用力抓紧穆丽儿的手。穆丽儿尾巴发力，将两人拉回了安全区域。","id":86},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","loop":"false","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.3","id":88},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.6","id":89},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","volume":"0.6","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":91},{"type":"text","text":"巨大的滚石和泥块迅速吞噬了BM的背包，又迅速滚落到坡底的山沟里，发出一声闷响。","id":92},{"type":"text","text":"灰尘散去，两人气喘吁吁地坐在地上。","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"呼……呼，人没事就好，别担心，物资还能再想办法，有我在，还能饿着你吗？","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"好在重要的勘探仪器不在那个包里，至于补给，我这里的还够撑一阵的。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"……嗯，没事，只是补给而已。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":100},{"type":"charslot","id":101},{"type":"text","text":"BM的脸色一变。她的指尖微微颤抖，视线焦虑地落在坡底那个隐隐约约露出一角的背包上，似乎在担忧着什么更重要的东西。","id":102},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":103,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"（BM看起来不太好，不过山体滑坡这种事，谁遇上了都会害怕吧……）","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"（嗯？那是……）","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":108},{"type":"charslot","id":109},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿顺着BM的目光，也注意到了那露出的一角，旁边散落着一些闪闪发光的金属管状物品。","id":110},{"type":"text","text":"她心中一凛，几乎立刻就认出来——那是矿石病抑制剂。","id":111},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿迅速转移了视线，没有让自己的表情有任何异样，只是若无其事地站起身，重新检查自己背包里的物品。","id":112},{"type":"text","text":"沉默就这样延续了一小段时间。","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"不好意思……我拖累你了。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"说什么呢？探险这种事，物资遗失不算什么啦。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"走吧，我们先去安全点的地方休息一下，等你情绪稳定一点再说。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":120},{"type":"charslot","id":121},{"type":"text","text":"BM垂下眼睛，默默地点了点头。","id":122},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":124},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":125},{"type":"charslot","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":127},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_bg_bg_campsite_d.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":128},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":129},{"type":"text","text":"第二天一早醒来，穆丽儿发现身边的位置空了，BM悄无声息地离开了营地。","id":130},{"type":"text","text":"她没有显出惊慌，只是安静地收拾起背包，开始沿着附近的山道缓缓寻找。","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"不久，她在一块远离营地的大岩石旁发现了BM。BM正坐在石头上，神情恍惚地望着远处，似乎已经坐了很久。","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"你怎么了？一声不吭就跑出来了。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"……欸？！","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"还是被你找到了。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"不要太小看你关注的探险家啊。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"哈……","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"……","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"对不起，我不想拖累你了。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":147},{"type":"charslot","id":148},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿安静地看着她，没有说话。","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"发这个“委托”……不，这原本甚至都算不上是“委托”。我不过是想再出来走走，看看没看过的地方罢了，没想过要走完。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"因为你回复了我，所以我才想着……要不让你陪我一起出门看看。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"我已经很满足了，能和自己最喜欢的偶像见面，还能一起探险，我这几天真的很开心。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"如果不是我不小心搞砸的话。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"……","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"你应该也看到了吧？我包里的……呃，药剂。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":162},{"type":"charslot","id":163},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿没说话，也没否认。","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"对不起，我不该瞒着你，更不该害你的物资也损失了。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"算了吧，我本来就是个麻烦，你不用在这里陪我继续浪费时间。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"哈，反正我的人生也没意义了，总有一天要爆炸的。这里嘛，毕竟是承载了这么多美好回忆的地方，要不干脆死在——","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"你在说什么啊？","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":173},{"type":"charslot","id":174},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿没再继续说些什么，只是从口袋中摸出一管药剂，塞到BM的手里，丝毫不管她惊愕的表情。","id":175},{"type":"text","text":"然后转过身，径直走到不远处的山体裂痕边缘，平静地取出勘探工具，专注地开始测量和记录数据。","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"你……你怎么……？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"我们不是来探险的吗？","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"要不要接我的委托——探矿的委托，粉丝小姐？","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"这条矿脉再往前走，应该能看到比较稀有的伴生矿，但我也没真的见过那种矿石，也不知道能不能找到呢。你要不要帮我？","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":185},{"type":"charslot","id":186},{"type":"text","text":"短暂的沉默后，BM低头苦笑了一下。她挣扎着站起身，缓缓走到穆丽儿身边，蹲下身帮她扶稳仪器，手上的动作异常认真。","id":187},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"charslot","id":191},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":192},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_n.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":193},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"那天直到下午两人没有再说话，只安静地沿路勘察。地势下沉，岩层褶皱丰富，每过一段路，两人就得停下来核对一次地貌记录。","id":195},{"type":"text","text":"晚些时候，山雾开始聚起。她们在一块风化破损得不是很严重的岩棚下扎营。火光不大，两人的影子在岩壁上被拉得很长。","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"说实话，我没想到，注意到我撤回的那条信息的人，以及最后陪我走这一趟的人会是你。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"欸？","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"因为你的风格一直以来都是独自探险嘛。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"那也得看旅伴是谁咯。我毕竟当初是看你的视频……","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"停停停，别给我这个粉丝贴金了。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"虽然看上去好像是误打误撞走到现在，但你其实来过这里吧？","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"嗯。几个月前，我刷到一个旧帖子，里面有一张模糊的断层照片。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"那张照片我一看就觉得眼熟，好像是我曾经拍过的某个地方。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"你记得自己拍过的所有岩层长什么样？","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"有些会记得。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"尤其是那张……那时我还是个刚开始探险的新手，一个人边走边哭，想找的矿脉找不到，补给又没带够，差点回不去。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"所以要再来一趟？","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"是呀，我很不甘心呢。之前的那次探险，我什么都没能带走，这次总要见识些什么再回去。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"还好这次你有了“山野生物在自然中的栖息状态”的照片。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":225},{"type":"charslot","id":226},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":227},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿笑着捶了BM一拳，同时把手电筒递给她，指了指前方一处小型的断裂岩层。","id":228},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"我们明天早上可以从这里绕上去看看，可能会有些新发现也说不定呢。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"charslot","id":232},{"type":"text","text":"BM接过手电筒，看了眼地图，又低下头，把它还了回去。","id":233},{"type":"text","text":"火光微颤，穆丽儿像是下定了什么决心一样，突然开口。","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"你还记得我发布的一个关于坑洞里的稀有矿的视频吗？","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"你是说我开始关注你的那个视频吗？","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"当时我吓了一跳呢，视频质量如此之高的博主竟然早就在关注我，不过在那之后，我就成为你的铁粉啦。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"嘿嘿……其实，那个视频，我本来没想拍的。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"第一次去的时候我压根没有找到矿，勘探也失败了，还在山脚下迷路了两天。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"回到城市里之后，我本来已经不打算继续更新了，还想着把库存的视频全都上传了之后，就注销账号。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"哈啊？！难怪你那个时候井喷一样地上传作品！","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"……但是最后你也没删。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"嗯，回家之后，我误发送了一张模糊的照片到一个群聊里，然后终端就开始震个不停。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"有人问我是不是改行做艺术摄影了，有人在猜这张图是不是我下一个视频的预告。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"还有一个人……回复我说“这片岩层的褶皱结构像是那一带南端山体的边界断层”。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"他还贴了对照图，说我照片拍得太糊了，下次记得加个偏振镜再拍。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"我不记得自己当时有没有回复他了……但是过了两天，我就按照这个人提的关键词查到了新的矿脉线索。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"后来……后来，我意外地发现了那片稀有矿石，然后就是你们看到的那个视频啦。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"只是因为陌生人的一句话……","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"嗯，就只是因为陌生人的一句话。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"……","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"穆丽儿，你……你比我坚强得多。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"我……我不知道。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"如果没有那个陌生人那句无心的回复，也许事情不会有变化。当然了，也许之后也会有其他的变化，但我的故事就是这样发展下去了。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"所以当你说，这是“最后一次探险”的时候，我想，我也应该像那个陌生人那样，对你说些什么。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"或者和你一起做些什么。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"charslot","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"在那一瞬间，穆丽儿突然有些愣神。","id":281},{"type":"text","text":"她说出口的故事，没说出口的故事，这些故事的主人公甚至开始不再是自己，而是面前的女孩。","id":282},{"type":"text","text":"她看着面前女孩的脸庞，那脸庞上分明挂着自己的模样。","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"在那个夜晚看着终端中陌生人贴出的回复，久久沉默的穆丽儿，在多年后的群聊中，执意要追着一条发出后就迅速撤回的消息。","id":284},{"type":"dialog","id":285},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":286},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":287},{"type":"charslot","id":288},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":289},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_bg_49_g13_smallroom.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":290},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"playsound","key":"$keyboard","volume":"1","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"“这是我的最后一次探险”……","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"不行，还是删掉这句吧……就算是最后一则视频，简介上也不用写这么矫情的话吧……","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"……","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"好气啊，明明是最后一次探险，可我什么都没找到。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"人生为什么总要有这样的遗憾呢？","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"charslot","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"那时她刚刚确诊矿石病，整晚整晚地睡不着觉。","id":306},{"type":"text","text":"除了害怕，更多的是难以接受自己的身体再也不能无所顾忌地长途穿越无人区……","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"再也不能全然不顾地半夜在岩层缝隙中取样，再也不能以为自己还有无尽的时间似的，对着矿物薄片发呆一整天——","id":308},{"type":"text","text":"那些“再也不能”，会比她曾以为的更快地到来。会比其他人、其他仍在探险的人、其他的……那些没有生病的穆丽儿，更快地到来。","id":309},{"type":"text","text":"她甚至一度以为，自己不属于这片大地了。","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"可是我好不甘心啊……真的好不甘心……","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"charslot","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":317},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_n.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":318},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":319},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":320},{"type":"text","text":"空气里只有木柴轻轻炸开的响声。","id":321},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿的眼神落在火光跳跃的石缝上，过了好久，像是这不过只是另一次寻常的探险一样，她突然轻轻开口。","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"BM，你饿不饿啊？","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"哈？突然好……接地气的一个问句。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"嘿嘿……因为讲了很多话，我饿了嘛。要不要吃宵夜？","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"我们还有宵夜可以吃？","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"……等等，别告诉我，你说的是那个——","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":333},{"type":"charslot","id":334},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿慢悠悠地从背包最底层翻出来一个压扁的饭盒，举到BM面前晃了晃。","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"不然呢？","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"你居然还特地留着！","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"本来是想留到最后庆祝我们找到矿石，但我想，现在庆祝也不错。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"毕竟我凭借强大的探险能力……找到了偷偷溜走的BM嘛。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"……","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"这也……太狼狈了吧……","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"探险嘛，狼狈才有纪念价值。","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":350},{"type":"charslot","id":351},{"type":"text","text":"BM无奈地点头，打开了那个饭盒——已经看不出当时“精心制作”的形态，由多种食材混合而成的干粮现在碎成一块一块的。","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"……确实很像昨天早上我们看到的那片岩层剖面。","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"至少，颜色上很相似……","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"是吧——","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"而且我一直觉得，如果一场探险的开头就那么狼狈，那结尾总该好一点的。","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"（嚼嚼）","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4171_wulfen_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"穆丽儿","text":"……竟然还挺好吃的，BM你快尝尝！","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a4/Avg_avg_4171_wulfen_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"……","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"真是的……肯定是因为好吃才给你的啊！","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":369},{"type":"charslot","id":370},{"type":"text","text":"两人相互看了看，终于憋不住大笑了起来。","id":371},{"type":"text","text":"月光融进摇曳的火光，夜色也一点一丝地在两人的笑声中逐渐隐去。","id":372},{"type":"dialog","id":373},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":374},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":375},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":376},{"type":"charslot","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":378},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_n.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":379},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":380},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":381,"musicid":2},{"type":"text","text":"晨风自崖顶泻下，将白雾撕成一缕缕淡影。BM提早醒来，悄悄起身，没有吵醒身边还蜷着的穆丽儿。","id":382},{"type":"text","text":"她沿着昨日标记的路径向上爬行，手指触到岩壁冰冷粗糙的纹路，鞋底在石粒间发出钝响。","id":383},{"type":"text","text":"她不知道自己在找些什么。","id":384},{"type":"text","text":"只是一个直觉，在她们昨天记录样本的时候，那一块褐灰色岩层里，有一丝奇异的反光。","id":385},{"type":"text","text":"天光破晓。","id":386},{"type":"dialog","id":387},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_m.png","screenadapt":"showall","fadetime":"4","id":388},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":389},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowfootstep","volume":"1","id":390},{"type":"text","text":"BM重新来到那个位置。","id":391},{"type":"text","text":"站在朝阳初升的悬崖前，她低头拨开石缝中的植物，刮去了岩石上的浮土。金色的晨光正好越过山口，斜照进这片裸露的岩面。","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"就在那一瞬，灰白的石层上有细小的闪斑绽开，像某种极其细密的星辰在岩层里生长。","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"……这是……？","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"这就是穆丽儿说的可能存在的稀有矿石吗？哈，原来并不是稀有矿，而是之前就见过的磷灰石……","id":395},{"type":"dialog","id":396},{"type":"charslot","id":397},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿其实早就醒来，提着工具包悄悄跟在BM后面爬上山。她站在远处，望着BM的背影，眼神中带着期待与一丝疼惜。","id":398},{"type":"text","text":"BM没有发现穆丽儿在自己的身后，她的视线跟着晨光在石纹中来回游走，像在寻找什么比矿石结构更精密的东西。","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"但是……","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“Basalt_Moon”","text":"为什么在阳光下会……","id":401},{"type":"dialog","id":402},{"type":"charslot","id":403},{"type":"text","text":"BM沉默了片刻，跪下，伸出手指轻轻触摸那一块磷灰石。","id":404},{"type":"text","text":"阳光越过她的肩膀洒下来，那层结晶在晨光的映照下缓慢地染上了新的颜色，蓝绿光斑跃动，像是在对她的靠近作出温柔回应。","id":405},{"type":"text","text":"BM愣了一会儿。","id":406},{"type":"text","text":"下一秒，她的肩膀颤了一下。","id":407},{"type":"text","text":"然后是手肘，脊背。眼泪几乎没有任何预兆地砸下来，砸在岩面上，砸在自己的手背上。","id":408},{"type":"text","text":"穆丽儿站定不动，感受着前方的BM无声又仿佛能够刺破鼓膜的恸哭。身后风穿过山谷，一只羽兽低声掠过悬崖，天光洒满整个山面。","id":409},{"type":"dialog","id":410},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":411},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":412},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":413},{"type":"character","id":414},{"type":"image","id":415}],"characters":["穆丽儿","“Basalt_Moon”"]}